      "id": "en:body",
      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Kennen unleashes a magical storm, dealing (40/80/120 + (25% Ability Power)) magic damage to all nearby enemies every 0.5 seconds, and gaining 25/50/75 Armor and 25/50/75 Magic Resist for 3 seconds. Successive hits deal 10% increased damage for each hit the enemy has already suffered. Enemies can only receive 3 stacks of Mark of the Storm from this ability.",
      "variant": null
    },
